        {
          "id": 1212438603,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "So this line won't have any effect anymore, because `conversation_set_dissector` is only effective for conversations that are found at the lower level. E.g., for setting the dissector to be used for a UDP port when heuristic dissectors were used. Since SNMP doesn't have a heuristic dissector, I guess it didn't make that much of a difference.",
