        {
          "id": 1212444859,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "It is necessary for right now because of the check that the conversation dissector is set to SNMP. Now that we're creating a conversation of type CONVERSATION_SNMP, perhaps setting the conversation dissector and checking for it on the SNMP conversation is not necessarily. However, setting the conversation dissector on the port-type conversation would be necessary if we had a heuristic dissector.",
